      "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:59:09.251Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi<br>\nWe don’t want use Batch wise valuation in Version 15.62,<br>\nBy default, when batch getting created system is tagging the use batch wise valuation</p>\n<p>due to this reason system is calculation COGS based on batch + Bin +SKU<br>\nwe want to system should take COGS based on FIFO method, already we have activated FIFO on stock settings, we already gone live for procurement, please respond as soon as possible,</p>\n<p>attaching screenshot of batch<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/d/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/d/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65_2_690x357.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kfXDGjPCBtwy9qKgVaUj8T8sCzj\" width=\"690\" height=\"357\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/d/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65_2_690x357.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/d/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65_2_1035x535.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/d/8df963f89c8b86d1cc2e43b37f6b0df6b69acc65.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1366×708 37.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
